```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A([Start]) --> B[Select PNG/JPEG or local path]
  B --> C{Readable image?}
  C -- No --> E[Show actionable error]
  C -- Yes --> D[Load BGR image]
  D --> Q[Compute quality metrics]
  D --> C2[Compute color palette]
  D --> S[Compute structure metrics]
  Q --> M[Merge typed results]
  C2 --> M
  S --> M
  M --> V[Review warnings and metrics]
  V --> X{Need machine-readable output?}
  X -- Yes --> J[Download / print JSON]
  X -- No --> Z([Finish])
  J --> Z
  E --> Z
```
